OL,3,GNEWSAFire hit landfill site set to
OL,4,Aclose by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operator of a landfill site that
OL,7,Fhas been hit by a number of fires says
OL,8,Fit is aiming to complete operations and
OL,9,Fclose the site by 2030.
OL,11,FIt comes as plans to extend operations
OL,12,Fat Greenways Landfill site at Appleford
OL,13,FSidings in Sutton Courtenay, which
OL,14,Fburned for 12 days in September, are
OL,15,Fset to be refused amid mounting
OL,16,Fcomplaints about its smell.
OL,18,FIn June, operator FCC Environment
OL,19,Fsubmitted plans to continue working at
OL,20,Fthe site until the end of 2039. Under
OL,21,Fcurrent permissions, landfilling there
OL,22,Fmust end in 2030.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
