OL,3,GNEWSAFire hit landfill site set to
OL,4,Aclose by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil officers have now recommended
OL,7,Frefusal of plans to extend the end date
OL,8,Fof the facility, along with a recycling
OL,9,Ffacility on the site until 2029.
